WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.114 --> 00:00:02.251
UNDER THE AGE OF 45.

00:00:02.285 --> 00:00:03.522
SHOULD THAT STATE STILL BE

00:00:03.523 --> 00:00:03.936
LOCKED DOWN?

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.309
"THE INGRAHAM ANGLE"

00:00:05.344 --> 00:00:06.025
INVESTIGATES.

00:00:06.027 --> 00:00:09.025
BUT FIRST, THE KIDS AREN’T ALL

00:00:09.027 --> 00:00:09.689
RIGHT.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.742
THAT IS THE FOCUS OF TONIGHT’S

00:00:13.744 --> 00:00:14.039
"ANGLE"."

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.347
ABOUT THREE QUARTERS OF THE

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:18.217
WORLD’S SCHOOLCHILDREN ARE NOT

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:20.203
IN SCHOOL, AND THEY ARE NOT

00:00:20.204 --> 00:00:21.733
THERE BECAUSE OF COVID-19.

00:00:21.734 --> 00:00:24.051
IT AFFECTS ABOUT 1.5 BILLION

00:00:24.085 --> 00:00:26.012
CHILDREN AND YOUNG PEOPLE.

00:00:26.046 --> 00:00:27.915
I SEARCHED, AND I CAN’T FIND ANY

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:29.258
EXAMPLE OF THIS EVER HAVING

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:32.008
HAPPENED ANYWHERE ELSE IN THE

00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:33.848
MODERN WORLD, NOT IN HISTORY.

00:00:33.849 --> 00:00:34.951
NOW, FEW DISAGREE THAT PROLONGED

00:00:34.952 --> 00:00:36.735
ABSENCE FROM THE CLASSROOM HAS

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:38.730
PROFOUND IMPLICATIONS FOR

00:00:38.764 --> 00:00:39.902
CHILDREN’S WELL-BEING.

00:00:39.937 --> 00:00:41.647
THERE DEVELOPMENT, AND THEIR

00:00:41.649 --> 00:00:43.473
KNOWLEDGE RETENTION.

00:00:43.475 --> 00:00:47.018
BLACK FRIDAY, ONE OF THE MOST

00:00:47.053 --> 00:00:47.934
RENOWNED PEDIATRIC

00:00:47.968 --> 00:00:48.961
SPECIALISTS IN THE WORLD,

00:00:48.962 --> 00:00:50.663
EXPRESSED HIS CONCERN ON THE

00:00:50.665 --> 00:00:52.189
SHOW ABOUT THE HARM THIS IS

00:00:52.223 --> 00:00:52.818
CAUSING.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.958
&gt;&gt; WE KNOW FROM STUDIES NOW OUT

00:00:54.959 --> 00:00:56.499
OF CHINA THAT DEPRESSION RATES

00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:59.563
IN KIDS WHO HAVE BEEN LOCKED

00:00:59.597 --> 00:01:01.073
DOWN ARE UP 20 TO 30%.

00:01:01.108 --> 00:01:03.291
WE KNOW THAT CHILDREN FROM LOW

00:01:03.292 --> 00:01:05.040
INCOME FAMILIES IN PARTICULAR

00:01:05.041 --> 00:01:06.655
FOR BEING HOMESCHOOLED, THEY ARE

00:01:06.689 --> 00:01:07.575
NOT GETTING AN ADEQUATE

00:01:07.609 --> 00:01:09.624
EDUCATION, BECAUSE THEIR PARENTS

00:01:09.658 --> 00:01:11.406
ARE WORKING, BECAUSE THEY DON’T

00:01:11.407 --> 00:01:12.637
HAVE HIGH-SPEED INTERNET, AND

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:15.095
THOSE KIDS ARE FALLING FURTHER

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.387
AND FURTHER BEHIND.

00:01:16.421 --> 00:01:18.040
&gt;&gt; Laura: AT RISK KIDS ARE

00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:20.112
ESPECIALLY VULNERABLE, CERTAINLY

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:21.314
THAT MAKES SENSE.

00:01:21.349 --> 00:01:23.066
ALMOST ALL MOMS WITH WHOM I

00:01:23.067 --> 00:01:24.835
SPEAK ARE FRUSTRATED, AND

00:01:24.869 --> 00:01:26.632
THEY’RE FRANKLY FRIGHTENED THAT

00:01:26.666 --> 00:01:28.291
THESE CLOSERS ARE GOING TO

00:01:28.325 --> 00:01:29.539
CONTINUE INDEFINITELY.

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:31.677
WHETHER PARENTS WORK OUTSIDE OR

00:01:31.678 --> 00:01:33.156
INSIDE THE HOME OR THEY ARE

00:01:33.191 --> 00:01:35.171
STAY-AT-HOME PARENTS, MOST ARE

00:01:35.206 --> 00:01:37.234
NOT WELL-SUITED TO BE TEACHING

00:01:37.268 --> 00:01:38.900
AN ARRAY OF SUBJECTS, ESPECIALLY

00:01:38.935 --> 00:01:40.685
IF THEY HAVE MULTIPLE CHILDREN.

00:01:40.686 --> 00:01:42.628
BY THE WAY, THE TEACHERS DON’T

00:01:42.629 --> 00:01:44.542
SEEM ALL THAT THRILLED, EITHER.

00:01:44.543 --> 00:01:47.021
TO SPEAK ALL OF MY KIDS IN MY

00:01:47.023 --> 00:01:48.725
CLASSROOM ARE ALL RELAXING,

00:01:48.726 --> 00:01:50.888
TALKING, MOVEMENT, BUSYNESS, AND

00:01:50.889 --> 00:01:54.851
I’VE GONE FROM THAT TO A TOTALLY

00:01:54.853 --> 00:01:56.674
DIFFERENT THING WHERE I AM AND

00:01:56.675 --> 00:01:58.605
I.T. PERSON LOOKING AT A SCREEN

00:01:58.639 --> 00:02:00.661
ALL DAY JUST TRYING TO HELP

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:02.133
PARENTS WITH TECH ISSUES ALL DAY

00:02:02.168 --> 00:02:02.793
LONG.

00:02:02.794 --> 00:02:04.782
&gt;&gt; Laura: OKAY, I’VE BEEN

00:02:04.816 --> 00:02:07.228
THERE, GUILTY AS CHARGED, TRYING

00:02:07.229 --> 00:02:09.257
TO FIGURE OUT THE TECH ISSUES.

00:02:09.291 --> 00:02:11.136
DIGITAL LEARNING, DISTANCE

00:02:11.137 --> 00:02:12.753
LEARNING, ONLINE CLASSES, THEY

00:02:12.754 --> 00:02:14.878
HAVE A PLACE AND THEY MAY WORK

00:02:14.912 --> 00:02:16.495
AS A SUPPLEMENT OR SHORT PERIODS

00:02:16.529 --> 00:02:18.940
OF TIME, BUT IT ALL GETS OLD

00:02:18.942 --> 00:02:20.377
FAST, AND IT LEADS, IN SOME

00:02:20.378 --> 00:02:22.789
CASES, TO A FEELING OF

00:02:22.823 --> 00:02:24.471
ISOLATION, AND IT JUST DOESN’T

00:02:24.473 --> 00:02:27.208
ENGAGE PEOPLE LIKE IN PERSON

00:02:27.242 --> 00:02:27.949
LEARNING.

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:29.995
YET, 192 COUNTRIES PULLED KIDS

00:02:29.996 --> 00:02:31.949
OUT OF SCHOOL, AND THESE

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:33.909
DECISIONS WERE BASED NOT SO MUCH

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:35.354
ON SCIENCE, BUT OUT OF AN

00:02:35.389 --> 00:02:36.319
ABUNDANCE OF CAUTION.

00:02:36.321 --> 00:02:37.586
YOU REALLY CAN’T BLAME PEOPLE.

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:38.608
EVERYONE IS WORRIED, FREAKING

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:40.694
OUT, DON’T WANT ANYTHING TO

00:02:40.696 --> 00:02:42.096
HAPPEN TO THEIR KIDS.

00:02:42.097 --> 00:02:44.499
SO WHAT DO WE KNOW NOW ABOUT THE

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:46.712
HEALTH RISKS TO CHILDREN AND TWO

00:02:46.746 --> 00:02:49.059
ADULTS IF THEY RETURN TO SCHOOL?

00:02:49.061 --> 00:02:50.616
WELL, WE KNOW NOW THAT

00:02:50.617 --> 00:02:51.616
OVERWHELMINGLY, CHILDREN DO NOT

00:02:51.617 --> 00:02:55.306
GET SERIOUSLY ILL FROM COVID,

00:02:55.307 --> 00:02:56.405
THANK GOODNESS.

00:02:56.439 --> 00:02:58.506
MOST TESTING POSITIVE OR TOTALLY

00:02:58.507 --> 00:02:59.198
ASYMPTOMATIC.

00:02:59.233 --> 00:03:00.788
RECENTLY, HEALTH OFFICIALS ARE

00:03:00.822 --> 00:03:02.365
REPORTING INSTANCES, THOUGH, OF

00:03:02.399 --> 00:03:04.952
AN INFLAMMATORY REACTION IN KIDS

00:03:04.987 --> 00:03:07.101
THAT COULD BE COVID-RELATED,

00:03:07.102 --> 00:03:08.576
ALTHOUGH IT IS ALSO RARELY

00:03:08.577 --> 00:03:08.918
FATAL.

00:03:08.953 --> 00:03:11.069
THE REAL DEBATE RIGHT NOW

00:03:11.071 --> 00:03:12.546
SURROUNDS HOW MUCH, IF AT ALL,

00:03:12.547 --> 00:03:13.409
CHILDREN SPREAD THE VIRUS TO

00:03:13.443 --> 00:03:14.348
ADULTS.

00:03:14.349 --> 00:03:17.428
THE IDEA THAT THEY ARE SILENT

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:18.441
SUPER-SPREADER’S -- THAT SOUNDED

00:03:18.475 --> 00:03:21.366
SUPER SCARY SOME WEEKS AGO --

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:22.795
BUT THAT BASICALLY HAS BEEN

00:03:22.796 --> 00:03:23.014
DEBUNKED.

00:03:23.048 --> 00:03:25.292
MORE RESEARCH IS NEEDED, YET WE

00:03:25.326 --> 00:03:26.919
REGARD THE SCHOOL ISSUE, MAYBE

00:03:26.921 --> 00:03:30.397
WE START THINKING ABOUT IT THIS

00:03:30.399 --> 00:03:32.608
WAY, A COMPARISON TO INFLUENZA

00:03:32.642 --> 00:03:33.503
MIGHT BE ILLUSTRATIVE.

00:03:33.537 --> 00:03:34.766
ACCORDING TO THE CDC’S NUMBERS,

00:03:34.768 --> 00:03:37.414
WHICH IS ALL WE HAVE TO GO BY,

00:03:37.449 --> 00:03:40.402
THIS PAST FLU SEASON WAS A VERY

00:03:40.437 --> 00:03:42.225
BAD ONE FOR CHILDREN.

00:03:42.259 --> 00:03:44.297
WHILE ONLY A HANDFUL OF CHILDREN

00:03:44.331 --> 00:03:47.769
DIED FROM COVID NATIONWIDE AS

00:03:47.802 --> 00:03:51.624
OF MAY 9TH, THE CDC REPORTED 174

00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:53.180
PEDIATRIC FLU DEATHS THIS SEASON

00:03:53.214 --> 00:03:53.861
SEASON.

00:03:53.895 --> 00:03:57.445
IN ADDITION, WE HAD 18 MILLION

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:58.887
MEDICAL VISITS AND 410,000

00:03:58.922 --> 00:03:59.946
HOSPITALIZATIONS DUE TO THE

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.956
INFLUENCE OF THE SEASON.

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:04.128
AGAIN, ACCORDING TO THE CDC.

00:04:04.129 --> 00:04:05.586
ON ITS WEBSITE, THE CDC

00:04:05.587 --> 00:04:09.560
ESTIMATES BETWEEN -- THIS IS

00:04:09.595 --> 00:04:12.079
CURIOUS -- 24,062,000

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.352
PRELIMINARY FLU DEATHS.

00:04:13.386 --> 00:04:14.975
THAT’S QUITE A RANGE.

00:04:15.009 --> 00:04:17.209
COMPLICATED, I GUESS, TO GET THE

00:04:17.243 --> 00:04:20.402
STATES TURNING IN ALL OF THEIR

00:04:20.436 --> 00:04:22.485
DATA, BUT COULD BE AS MANY AS

00:04:22.486 --> 00:04:23.692
62,000.

00:04:23.727 --> 00:04:28.784
WHY DIDN’T WE HEAR ABOUT THE FLU

00:04:28.785 --> 00:04:31.122
VIS-A-VIS KIDS IN SCHOOL.

00:04:31.156 --> 00:04:33.028
EVEN WITH A DOUBLE BARREL OF

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:34.706
THREATS OF INFLUENZA A AND

00:04:34.707 --> 00:04:36.043
INFLUENZA B, WHICH KIDS WERE

00:04:36.044 --> 00:04:37.557
SUSCEPTIBLE TO THE SEASON, AND

00:04:37.558 --> 00:04:39.728
THE FACT IT’S HIGHLY CONTAGIOUS

00:04:39.761 --> 00:04:41.533
AMONG CLASSMATES, WE HAD NO WHY

00:04:41.567 --> 00:04:42.637
SKILL SCHOOL CLOSERS IN THE

00:04:42.638 --> 00:04:43.029
UNITED STATES.

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:44.883
I DIDN’T EVEN HEAR ANYONE

00:04:44.884 --> 00:04:45.834
SUGGESTING THEM.

00:04:45.835 --> 00:04:48.141
EVEN DURING THE SWINE FLU

00:04:48.142 --> 00:04:51.040
EPIDEMIC, ONLY ABOUT 726 OF THE

00:04:51.073 --> 00:04:54.081
MORE THAN 131,000 K-12 SCHOOLS

00:04:54.115 --> 00:04:55.501
IN THE COUNTRY SHUTDOWN.

00:04:55.535 --> 00:04:57.453
I’M NOT SAYING COVID-19, BY THE

00:04:57.455 --> 00:04:58.669
WAY, IS LIKE THE FLU.

00:04:58.704 --> 00:04:59.441
IT IS NOT.

00:04:59.475 --> 00:05:01.851
BUT WHAT I AM SAYING IS FAR MORE

00:05:01.886 --> 00:05:03.138
CHILDREN DIED OF INFLUENZA THIS

00:05:03.139 --> 00:05:03.947
YEAR, THAT IT’S HIGHLY

00:05:03.982 --> 00:05:06.349
CONTAGIOUS AMONG THEM, YET NO

00:05:06.383 --> 00:05:08.179
ONE SERIOUSLY CONSIDERED KEEPING

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.246
MOST OF OUR NATION’S

00:05:09.247 --> 00:05:10.944
SCHOOLCHILDREN AT HOME BECAUSE

00:05:10.945 --> 00:05:13.514
OF THE DANGER.

00:05:13.516 --> 00:05:16.268
NOW, LAST MONTH, A REVIEW WAS

00:05:16.269 --> 00:05:18.188
PUBLISHED OF PAST CORONAVIRUS

00:05:18.189 --> 00:05:20.294
STUDIES, AND IT SUGGESTS THAT

00:05:20.295 --> 00:05:22.468
CLOSING SCHOOLS MAY ONLY HAVE A

00:05:22.469 --> 00:05:23.913
MINOR ROLE IN SUPPRESSING

00:05:23.914 --> 00:05:24.220
COVID-19.

00:05:24.221 --> 00:05:26.921
YOU LOOK AT THE DATA FROM SARS

00:05:26.955 --> 00:05:28.728
AND THAT OUTBREAK IN MAINLAND

00:05:28.763 --> 00:05:31.052
CHINA, HONG KONG, AND SINGAPORE,

00:05:31.053 --> 00:05:33.562
AND IT SUGGESTS SCHOOL

00:05:33.563 --> 00:05:34.487
TRANSMISSIONS PLAYED NO

00:05:34.489 --> 00:05:35.362
SUBSTANTIAL ROLE IN THE

00:05:35.363 --> 00:05:35.736
OUTBREAK.

00:05:35.738 --> 00:05:38.896
AND THAT SCHOOL CLOSURES AND

00:05:38.898 --> 00:05:42.313
OTHER ACTIVITIES, SUCH AS SCHOOL

00:05:42.314 --> 00:05:43.667
TEMPERATURE MONITORING, DID NOT

00:05:43.668 --> 00:05:44.873
CONTRIBUTE TO THE CONTROL OF

00:05:44.875 --> 00:05:45.443
INFECTIOUS TRANSMISSION.

00:05:45.444 --> 00:05:47.823
I GUESS WE WILL SEE HOW IT GOES

00:05:47.824 --> 00:05:50.051
WITH COVID-19, BUT CERTAINLY

00:05:50.052 --> 00:05:51.153
WORTH NOTING THAT.

00:05:51.154 --> 00:05:53.030
NOW, IN SWEDEN, SCHOOLCHILDREN

00:05:53.064 --> 00:05:54.860
THERE WERE NEVER PULLED FROM

00:05:54.894 --> 00:05:56.560
SCHOOLS, AND MEANWHILE, THE

00:05:56.561 --> 00:05:58.243
GUARDIAN REPORTS THAT REOPENING

00:05:58.244 --> 00:06:01.297
SCHOOLS IN 22 EUROPEAN COUNTRIES

00:06:01.332 --> 00:06:03.344
HAS NOT LED TO

00:06:03.378 --> 00:06:05.019
ANY SIGNIFICANT INCREASE IN

00:06:05.021 --> 00:06:06.710
CORONAVIRUS INFECTIONS AMONG

00:06:06.711 --> 00:06:08.691
CHILDREN, AMONG PARENTS, OR

00:06:08.692 --> 00:06:09.245
STAFF.

00:06:09.246 --> 00:06:11.266
NOW, THERE WAS A THING IN

00:06:11.267 --> 00:06:12.314
FRANCE, 70 PEOPLE IN AN

00:06:12.315 --> 00:06:13.979
OUTBREAK, BUT OUT OF A HUGE

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:15.290
NUMBER OF PEOPLE BACK IN SCHOOL,

00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:17.292
THEY HAVE A HANDLE ON THAT.

00:06:17.326 --> 00:06:19.723
TODAY, I WENT ON A TWO HOUR BIKE

00:06:19.758 --> 00:06:20.886
RIDE THROUGH D.C. WITH MY

00:06:20.921 --> 00:06:22.410
11-YEAR-OLD, WENT THROUGH THE

00:06:22.411 --> 00:06:24.097
WOODS, WENT THROUGH PARTS OF THE

00:06:24.131 --> 00:06:26.695
CITY, AND ALL FOUR OF US GO ON

00:06:26.697 --> 00:06:27.949
THESE LONG WALKS IN THE WOODS,

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:28.437
MOST MORNINGS.

00:06:28.438 --> 00:06:30.266
MY KIDS AND I.

00:06:30.299 --> 00:06:32.216
THAT’S BEEN A TREAT FOR ME.

00:06:32.251 --> 00:06:33.459
AND FOR THEM, USUALLY, ALTHOUGH

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:34.855
SOMETIMES THEY ROLL THEIR EYES

00:06:34.856 --> 00:06:36.086
AT ME, BUT THAT’S JUST THE WAY

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:36.937
IT GOES.

00:06:36.971 --> 00:06:38.614
THESE ARE MEMORIES I CHERISH

00:06:38.615 --> 00:06:39.707
BECAUSE THEY ARE HOME FROM

00:06:39.742 --> 00:06:40.941
SCHOOL, WE CAN DO THAT.

00:06:40.975 --> 00:06:42.668
BUT I HAVE TO SAY I’M REALLY

00:06:42.669 --> 00:06:44.077
WORRIED ABOUT HOW MUCH THEY

00:06:44.078 --> 00:06:45.110
REALLY LEARNED THIS SEMESTER.

00:06:45.144 --> 00:06:46.986
EVEN HOW GREAT THEIR TEACHERS

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:48.805
ARE, IT’S STILL NOT THE SAME,

00:06:48.806 --> 00:06:50.879
AND I SEE HOW MUCH THEY MISS

00:06:50.913 --> 00:06:51.792
THEIR FRIENDS AND THEIR

00:06:51.827 --> 00:06:54.196
TEACHERS, AND THE ADMINISTRATORS

00:06:54.197 --> 00:06:54.912
AT THEIR SCHOOLS.

00:06:54.946 --> 00:06:57.603
I’M ALSO THINKING -- AND WE PRAY

00:06:57.637 --> 00:06:59.217
FOR THIS EVERY NIGHT -- ABOUT

00:06:59.251 --> 00:07:00.909
THE LESS FORTUNATE AMONG US.

00:07:00.944 --> 00:07:02.296
THEY DON’T HAVE ANY HELP, THEY

00:07:02.297 --> 00:07:03.628
DON’T HAVE THE LUXURY OF

00:07:03.629 --> 00:07:05.778
VENTURING INTO NATURE EVERY DAY,

00:07:05.812 --> 00:07:06.069
PERHAPS.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:07.034
AND WHAT ABOUT THE FRONT-LINE

00:07:07.068 --> 00:07:07.667
WORKERS?

00:07:07.668 --> 00:07:09.917
THEY CAN’T FIND CHILD CARE OR

00:07:09.918 --> 00:07:11.040
SOMEONE TO SUPPLEMENT THE

00:07:11.041 --> 00:07:11.804
TEACHING OF THEIR KIDS.

00:07:11.838 --> 00:07:13.618
WHAT HAPPENS IF UNEMPLOYED

00:07:13.619 --> 00:07:16.567
PEOPLE IN THE FALL FIND JOBS --

00:07:16.601 --> 00:07:20.342
WE HOPE THEY DO -- YET THEIR

00:07:20.343 --> 00:07:22.321
KIDS SCHOOLS SAY "SORRY, THEY

00:07:22.323 --> 00:07:24.025
ARE NOT COMING BACK?"

00:07:24.026 --> 00:07:25.802
WE NEED TO GET CREATIVE AND NOT

00:07:25.803 --> 00:07:26.519
ABANDON CLASSROOM LEARNING,

00:07:26.521 --> 00:07:28.500
CERTAINLY SINCE WE DON’T HAVE

00:07:28.502 --> 00:07:30.928
ANY REAL DATA TO BACK THIS UP.

00:07:30.929 --> 00:07:31.991
NOW, CHECK THIS OUT.

00:07:31.992 --> 00:07:32.648
CAMBRIDGE UNIVERSITY HAS

00:07:32.683 --> 00:07:33.855
BASICALLY GIVEN UP, AND THEY’VE

00:07:33.889 --> 00:07:35.149
ANNOUNCED THEY ARE NOT OPENING

00:07:35.184 --> 00:07:37.909
UNTIL I THINK THE SUMMER OF

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.414
2021, AT THIS POINT.

00:07:39.415 --> 00:07:42.523
BUT WE CAN BE SMARTER, AND R.

00:07:42.525 --> 00:07:43.628
NOTRE DAME JUST ANNOUNCED THAT

00:07:43.663 --> 00:07:45.464
ITS OPENING IN THE FALL BUT THEY

00:07:45.465 --> 00:07:46.761
ARE GOING TO END THEIR SEMESTER

00:07:46.796 --> 00:07:47.766
A LITTLE EARLY AND KILL THE FALL

00:07:47.767 --> 00:07:48.138
BREAK.

00:07:48.139 --> 00:07:49.859
I DON’T KNOW WHY THEY HAVE THE

00:07:49.894 --> 00:07:50.986
FALL BREAK ANYWAY THERE, BUT

00:07:50.987 --> 00:07:53.277
THEY ARE KILLING THAT IN CASE

00:07:53.311 --> 00:07:54.411
THERE IS A SECOND WAVE.

00:07:54.446 --> 00:07:56.530
THEY ARE MODERATING, BUT GETTING

00:07:56.531 --> 00:07:57.718
PEOPLE BACK.

00:07:57.753 --> 00:08:01.119
KIDS NEED SCHOOL AT ALL AGES.

00:08:01.154 --> 00:08:03.554
WE CAN PROTECT THEIR HEALTH, AND

00:08:03.556 --> 00:08:04.618
WE CAN PROTECT THEIR MINDS.

00:08:04.619 --> 00:08:07.034
WE CAN USE OUR INNOVATION, AND

00:08:07.068 --> 00:08:08.659
WE CAN USE OUR COMMON SENSE.

